        "template_for_hidden": "",
        "heading": "INTRODUCING THE PNW PACK",
        "text": "<p>Inspired by the majestic landscapes of the Pacific Northwest, this assortment of gear is a nod to the natural beauty and elegance that surrounds us every day here at TRUE HQ. Whether you’re teeing off on a misty morning or enjoying a sunny afternoon on the links, this collection offers the perfect blend of luxury, comfort, and ruggedness utilizing colors and tones found in our own backyard. <br\/><br\/>Available in 3 unique footwear models for men and women along with several apparel items while supplies last.<\/p>",
        "heading_type": "h4",
        "padding_top": 100,
        "padding_bottom": 0,
        "mobile_padding_top": 70,
        "mobile_padding_bottom": 0
      }
    },
